  "question": {
    "text": "If in a triangle $A B C, \\frac{b+c}{11}=\\frac{c+a}{12}=\\frac{a+b}{13}$, then $\\cos \\mathrm{A}$ is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
